The skills in this repository are original works. Several of them reimplement, in
original wording and structure, well-known engineering practices and workflow ideas
that have been popularized by the open-source Claude Code / agent-skills community —
notably staged spec→ticket flows, TDD-at-seams, dual-axis code review, throwaway
feasibility spikes, and red-repro-first bug diagnosis.

No third-party skill files are redistributed here. Where a practice was learned from
another author's open-source skill, credit is due to that community; the text in this
repository was written independently for this pack.
